WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.053
The rabbits were all staring at Rabbit.

2
00:00:09.054 --> 00:00:14.565
"Where are your legs and feet?" the white rabbit asked.

3
00:00:14.566 --> 00:00:21.469
Rabbit sighed. "I don't have legs or feet."

4
00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:23.810
The brown rabbit frowned.

5
00:00:23.811 --> 00:00:26.392
"But you're a rabbit, right?"

6
00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:31.673
"He has a nose like a rabbit," the spotted one said.

7
00:00:31.674 --> 00:00:35.257
"And rabbit ears!"

8
00:00:35.258 --> 00:00:39.009
Rabbit nodded. "I'm a rabbit.

9
00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:42.683
But I can't jump."

10
00:00:42.684 --> 00:00:47.306
The rabbits still looked confused.

11
00:00:47.307 --> 00:00:50.400
"I know!" the spotted one said.

12
00:00:50.401 --> 00:00:53.124
"We'll show you how to jump.

13
00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:57.093
Watch us!"

14
00:00:57.094 --> 00:01:00.631
The rabbits jumped all around.

15
00:01:00.632 --> 00:01:03.675
Rabbit watched and then tried to jump.

16
00:01:03.676 --> 00:01:07.353
But no matter how hard he tried . . .

17
00:01:07.354 --> 00:01:09.295
He couldn't move.

18
00:01:09.296 --> 00:01:14.320
Rabbit's ears drooped. "I give up."

19
00:01:14.321 --> 00:01:18.985
The brown rabbit sighed. "Too bad.

20
00:01:18.986 --> 00:01:22.626
If you want to try again, look for us."

21
00:01:22.627 --> 00:01:26.618
"We live near the field," the white one said.

22
00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:32.651
"Thanks," Rabbit said.

23
00:01:32.652 --> 00:01:37.981
He watched the rabbits hop away.

24
00:01:37.982 --> 00:01:42.182
"They look so free," Rabbit thought.

25
00:01:42.183 --> 00:01:48.261
"Will I ever hop and jump like them?"

26
00:01:48.262 --> 00:01:57.256
A few days passed.

27
00:01:57.257 --> 00:02:01.479
One morning Henry put Rabbit on a tree stump.

28
00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:05.987
"It's our last day here," Henry said sadly.

29
00:02:05.988 --> 00:02:12.696
"We're going home."

30
00:02:12.697 --> 00:02:16.362
"Home!" Rabbit thought happily.

31
00:02:16.363 --> 00:02:19.693
He missed his friends from the playroom.

32
00:02:19.694 --> 00:02:23.649
But then he remembered the outside rabbits.

33
00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:25.234
His ears drooped.

34
00:02:25.235 --> 00:02:34.890
"I'll never see them again," he thought.

